on recall of critical carrying-capacity deficits. Crucially,) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.648256 Tw (the satellite pipeline discovers 323 unmonitored hidden hotspots in regions completely lacking ground stations. The project includes saved inference) Tj T* 0 Tw .365232 Tw (artefacts, a FastAPI prediction endpoint, and a Streamlit dashboard. The paper reports an engineering implementation and its experimental evaluation; it) Tj T* 0 Tw (does not claim a new neural-network architecture or clustering algorithm.) Tj T* ET
